&lt;h2 id=&#34;post&#34;&gt;Post&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outstanding experience in North Sea and Helgoland on the Research Vessel Heincke in April 2024.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I had the chance to join the physical oceanography group. I ran and processed Conductivity, Temperature, and Depth (CTD), Sound Velocity Profiler (SVP), and Acoustic Doppler Current Profiler (ADCP) measurements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks to @awiexpedition and the graduate school POLMAR together with all the crew members&lt;/p&gt;


